  <item>
    <title>Inside Gil Hanse&#x27;s Aronimink Restoration BACK to Donald Ross&#x27; 1928 Design</title>
    <link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=swHFWypmPF8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=swHFWypmPF8</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 19:54:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <dc:creator>Skratch</dc:creator>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Ahead of the PGA Championship at Aronimink Golf Club, Gil Hanse oversaw a massive restoration to return the course to its original 1928 Donald Ross design. We toured the course alongside the Rolex testimonee and visited his studio to find out more about the process and what it took to bring Ross&#x27; vision back to life.

The intersection of golf and culture.

